stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Proposed
  Proposed --> SchemaValidated: schema pass
  SchemaValidated --> SemanticallyValidated: ontology pass
  SemanticallyValidated --> Reviewed: curator review
  Reviewed --> Approved: approve
  Reviewed --> Rejected: reject
  Approved --> Applied: local transactional apply
  SemanticallyValidated --> ExtensionRequested: novel valid concept
  ExtensionRequested --> Proposed: ontology release + rebase
  Applied --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
